+      <dd>
+          Binds the given WebGLBuffer object to the given binding point(target). <em>target</em> is given in the following table:
+          <table>
+              <tr><th>target</th></tr>
+              <tr><td>ARRAY_BUFFER</td></tr>
+              <tr><td>COPY_READ_BUFFER</td></tr>
+              <tr><td>COPY_WRITE_BUFFER</td></tr>
