+              <tr><td>TRANSFORM_FEEDBACK_BUFFER</td></tr>
+              <tr><td>UNIFORM_BUFFER</td></tr>
+          </table>
+          <p>If <em>target</em> is not in the table above, generates an <code>INVALID_ENUM</code> error.</p>
