+        <p>Returns <code>FRAMEBUFFER_UNSUPPORTED</code> if depth and stencil attachments, if present, are not the same image. See <a href="#FBO_ATTACHMENTS">Framebuffer Object Attachments</a> for detailed discussion.</p>
